M0Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/009b9cedd09e773ea6acf5951c0d63b652279d2a","sha":"009b9cedd09e773ea6acf5951c0d63b652279d2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/009b9cedd09e773ea6acf5951c0d63b652279d2a"}],"sha":"4c96f4bcc63a4b16c9f9c6399cc796e1b57234cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/4c96f4bcc63a4b16c9f9c6399cc796e1b57234cf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/009b9cedd09e773ea6acf5951c0d63b652279d2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-11T04:41:07Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-11T04:41:07Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"message":"Improve table height calculation and layout consistency across modules\n\nRefactors AgGridTable to use ResizeObserver and MutationObserver for dynamic height calculation, improving layout stability. Updates various modules (CrewPool, Drug/Alcohol tests, Promotions, Recruitment) to utilize flex-1 for proper height expansion within their containers, removing conflicting min-height styles and simplifying layout logic.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 286b9da2-691c-4edd-bebe-06d096e75d9f\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: a6da9997-d90f-4e1b-b238-71e05c893c83\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/286b9da2-691c-4edd-bebe-06d096e75d9f/O0VHNCl","tree":{"sha":"b8af9b0ff1a3e2e6973cd7f3484b8107a772ee03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/b8af9b0ff1a3e2e6973cd7f3484b8107a772ee03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/009b9cedd09e773ea6acf5951c0d63b652279d2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/009b9cedd09e773ea6acf5951c0d63b652279d2a","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKDAwOWI5Y2VkZDA5ZTc3M2VhNmFjZjU5NTFjMGQ2M2I2NTIyNzlkMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/86300152aa110a4aa5d2f1c399c45ac353c0de22","sha":"86300152aa110a4aa5d2f1c399c45ac353c0de22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/86300152aa110a4aa5d2f1c399c45ac353c0de22"}],"sha":"009b9cedd09e773ea6acf5951c0d63b652279d2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/009b9cedd09e773ea6acf5951c0d63b652279d2a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/86300152aa110a4aa5d2f1c399c45ac353c0de22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-11T04:21:42Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-11T04:21:42Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"message":"Improve table display to fill available screen height dynamically\n\nIntroduce a new `fillAvailableHeight` prop to the `AgGridTable` component, allowing tables to dynamically adjust their height to fill the available viewport space. This change standardizes table sizing across various modules, including Crew Pool, Promotions, and Drugs & Alcohol, by removing fixed height calculations and implementing a responsive height adjustment mechanism. The component now uses a ref to measure container position and calculates the remaining viewport height, ensuring tables adapt to different screen sizes and reduce empty space below them.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 286b9da2-691c-4edd-bebe-06d096e75d9f\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: d6ecbf13-c768-4c35-9d03-eeb675daa507\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://sto