l type filtering to recruitment and master data views\n\nIntegrate dynamic fetching and filtering of vessel types from the `/api/masters/004/data` endpoint into the `RecruitmentModule.tsx` component, replacing hardcoded options with fetched data and adding a fallback to static data. The vessel type filter''s logic is updated to robustly handle undefined levels by defaulting them to level 2.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: baaf7e52-b653-417e-85d6-59425035e19d\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 2bb2b742-3edc-449f-b625-031ed5868e76\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/baaf7e52-b653-417e-85d6-59425035e19d/9oMERQS","tree":{"sha":"d0d94a952da6f8f8c7addcee332bd21dd0793d83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/d0d94a952da6f8f8c7addcee332bd21dd0793d83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/e1a4cf089607b09b4131455c8c89c3ea710f92c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/e1a4cf089607b09b4131455c8c89c3ea710f92c1","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKGUxYTRjZjA4OTYwN2IwOWI0MTMxNDU1YzhjODljM2VhNzEwZjkyYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/b0f157faea9ca47f65373d420611497fb964acb0","sha":"b0f157faea9ca47f65373d420611497fb964acb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/b0f157faea9ca47f65373d420611497fb964acb0"}],"sha":"e1a4cf089607b09b4131455c8c89c3ea710f92c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/e1a4cf089607b09b4131455c8c89c3ea710f92c1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/b0f157faea9ca47f65373d420611497fb964acb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-04T03