-Commit-Session-Id: 9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: f7a793e0-e541-426f-ac35-6c6e462e862f\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43/2Bs2yoY","tree":{"sha":"5001903eae5a61749f1a5bc088a7581367fcd8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/5001903eae5a61749f1a5bc088a7581367fcd8ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/60e4aef43a93d4f237f9a61f1aa0e6275be28f3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/60e4aef43a93d4f237f9a61f1aa0e6275be28f3d","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKDYwZTRhZWY0M2E5M2Q0ZjIzN2Y5YTYxZjFhYTBlNjI3NWJlMjhmM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/30ba7b57556f4dcb11f09d0530f7b32cff7063e2","sha":"30ba7b57556f4dcb11f09d0530f7b32cff7063e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/30ba7b57556f4dcb11f09d0530f7b32cff7063e2"}],"sha":"60e4aef43a93d4f237f9a61f1aa0e6275be28f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/60e4aef43a93d4f237f9a61f1aa0e6275be28f3d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/30ba7b57556f4dcb11f09d0530f7b32cff7063e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-30T04:51:15Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-30T04:51:15Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"message":"Update timeline to use multi-segment bars for assignments\n\nRefactors the `TimelineCard` component to utilize a new multi-segment bar drawing function (`drawAssignmentBar`) for rendering service assignments, improving visual representation and data accuracy. This includes updating color logic for different assignment statuses (planned, completed, active) and ensuring correct bar segment calculations based on contract end dates and range end dates. The `drawAssignmentBar` function is now memoized using `useCallback` and added to `useEffect` dependencies for performance optimization. The filtering logic has also been updated to use `rangeEndDate` for accurate visibility detection of assignments.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 41dd9384-af25-4412-995c-e77feb7782be\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43/dlIEOam","tree":{"sha":"5001903eae5a61749f1a5bc088a7581367fcd8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/5001903eae5a61749f1a5bc088a7581367fcd8ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/30ba7b57556f4dcb11f09d0530f7b32cff7063e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/30ba7b57556f4dcb11f09d0530f7b32cff7063e2","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKDMwYmE3YjU3NTU2ZjRkY2IxMWYwOWQwNTMwZjdiMzJjZmY3MDYzZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/d4eedb3208ef2321160ea42a473e0cd7eccdf573","sha":"d4eedb3208ef2321160ea42a473e0cd7eccdf573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/d4eedb3208ef2321160ea42a473e0cd7eccdf573"}],"sha":"30ba7b57556f4dcb11f09d0530f7b32cff7063e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/30ba7b57556f4dcb11f09d0530f7b32cff7063e2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov