0-08T20:53:44.400Z","repositoryId":1094870669,"sha":"55a060b2386155fb24346b65b23cc485d611b7f7"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:53:44.400Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/114108cb0a0a5b3fbde8642b8b48b3afd55d6919/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-29T09:09:30Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-29T09:09:30Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"message":"Update timeline to correctly display assignment status and badge positioning\n\nFixes color logic for assignment status based on contractEndDate and rangeEndDate, and correctly positions appraisal and handover badges on the timeline canvas.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 8fc90af1-22e9-479d-8bf0-25630d1e51e8\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43/5GmXpp4","tree":{"sha":"63b22ffced1d355f0fcec41f11c11cce3b915773","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/63b22ffced1d355f0fcec41f11c11cce3b915773"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/114108cb0a0a5b3fbde8642b8b48b3afd55d6919","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/114108cb0a0a5b3fbde8642b8b48b3afd55d6919","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKDExNDEwOGNiMGEwYTViM2ZiZGU4NjQyYjhiNDhiM2FmZDU1ZDY5MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/385d0a0752f76848ebb63b2bd24be6ac363bad8a","sha":"385d0a0752f76848ebb63b2bd24be6ac363bad8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/c