630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"message":"Update license management to use unique IDs for duplicate detection\n\nRefactor license management to use `licenseId` for duplicate detection instead of certificate names. This involves changes in `CrewInfoForm.tsx`, `LicenseSelectionDialog.tsx`, and `licenseDceTemplates.ts`, along with updating the SQL migration script `0012_update_license_entry_ids.sql` to reflect the new ID format.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: fa823d36-6f2e-4c7c-ba6e-795cb4e70f68\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43/HH5bDkh","tree":{"sha":"bea3c27629fb448a95cfe83e3ed3b04896bc86fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/bea3c27629fb448a95cfe83e3ed3b04896bc86fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/2d313dac6cc7948c6ee16c3f858c2f64b69cab92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/2d313dac6cc7948c6ee16c3f858c2f64b69cab92","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKDJkMzEzZGFjNmNjNzk0OGM2ZWUxNmMzZjg1OGMyZjY0YjY5Y2FiOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/502c4ff3892ad933f259c5ffeeb18102554e9758","sha":"502c4ff3892ad933f259c5ffeeb18102554e9758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/502c4ff3892ad933f259c5ffeeb18102554e9758"}],"sha":"2d313dac6cc7948c6ee16c3f858c2f64b69cab92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/2d313dac6cc7948c6ee16c3f858c2f64b69cab92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/502c4ff3892ad933f259c5ffe