6"},"message":"Add ability to select and add licenses from a managed database\n\nIntroduces a new LicenseSelectionDialog component for selecting licenses from a master data API, integrating it into the CrewInfoForm and updating the \"Add License from Database\" button functionality.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: e939439e-fa1f-4624-b93c-5640936eac3d\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43/dcGD5AS","tree":{"sha":"e26630c4c82aba2f396cd0f39a58781b710cfe7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/e26630c4c82aba2f396cd0f39a58781b710cfe7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/049dd6da88b948d835585fbd910f39aa82afc57a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/049dd6da88b948d835585fbd910f39aa82afc57a","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKDA0OWRkNmRhODhiOTQ4ZDgzNTU4NWZiZDkxMGYzOWFhODJhZmM1N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/93a1a017fe24eb66414c97e18315d87b17713be7","sha":"93a1a017fe24eb66414c97e18315d87b17713be7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/93a1a017fe24eb66414c97e18315d87b17713be7"}],"sha":"049dd6da88b948d835585fbd910f39aa82afc57a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/049dd6da88b948d835585fbd910f39aa82afc57a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/93a1a017fe24eb66414c97e18315d87b17713be7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T11:04:48Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"comment_count":0,"commit