count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T08:13:49Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"message":"Add Oil Chemical Tanker experience to sea service records\n\nIntroduces the ''Oil Chemical Tanker'' vessel type and its associated experience categories (''oil'', ''chemical'') within the `CrewInfoForm`. This includes database migration to add the new vessel type and UI updates in `CrewInfoForm.tsx` to allow users to select these experience types. The `SeaService` interface is updated to include `experienceCategories`, and the `VESSEL_TYPE_HIERARCHY` in `vesselTypes.ts` is extended.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: f51b34ca-dc4a-4862-a6c5-871f2333b1f0\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43/MMBF4VA","tree":{"sha":"7905d0ff85195e5953d9d926d15156be85c94629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/7905d0ff85195e5953d9d926d15156be85c94629"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/217202d3b68aef6685e4961bf28cf7bee3ad7e18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/217202d3b68aef6685e4961bf28cf7bee3ad7e18","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKDIxNzIwMmQzYjY4YWVmNjY4NWU0OTYxYmYyOGNmN2JlZTNhZDdlMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/5d24aa221d6b65391efae1ad6ed46a9f082071ed","sha":"5d24aa221d6b65391efae1ad6ed46a9f082071ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/5d24aa221d6b65391efae1ad6ed46a9f082071ed"}],"sha":"217202d3b68aef6685e4961bf28cf7bee3ad7e18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/co