es/crewdevnov12/commits/e86c4452ae16fb965cafe56117bf771de418b311/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T07:07:35Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T07:07:35Z","email":"43464630-sahilpuri6@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"sahilpuri6"},"message":"Automatically calculate sea service periods and ensure fields are read-only\n\nAdds a helper function `calculateSeaServicePeriod` to accurately calculate the period in months based on provided start and end dates, using an average of 30.44 days per month. This function is used to recalculate `periodMonths` for existing sea service records during data hydration in the `CrewInfoForm`.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: 9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Event-Id: 99ae4bb4-8e0f-42c8-818a-f44ac511cdb2\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/a558a1c7-b39f-4031-aee1-137977a41781/9dff7e17-44d5-4605-8578-fdba13608c43/2VrASIt","tree":{"sha":"8cac0382e8eae6039238b05b8037d55d7c81219b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/trees/8cac0382e8eae6039238b05b8037d55d7c81219b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/git/commits/e86c4452ae16fb965cafe56117bf771de418b311","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/e86c4452ae16fb965cafe56117bf771de418b311","node_id":"C_kwDOQUJmjdoAKGU4NmM0NDUyYWUxNmZiOTY1Y2FmZTU2MTE3YmY3NzFkZTQxOGIzMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commit/99cdcc5b928a9a2b2483b16056f2e958d34a728d","sha":"99cdcc5b928a9a2b2483b16056f2e958d34a728d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/safe-lanes/crewdevnov12/commits/99cdcc5b928a9a2b2483b16056f2e958d34a728d"}],"sha":"e86c