m","name":"Aashish Sharma"},"message":"mgr/dashboard: allow deletion of non-default zone and zonegroup\n\nFixes: https://tracker.ceph.com/issues/73708\n\nSigned-off-by: Aashish Sharma <aasharma@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c0da8740f95268757943cce96493d6170193547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/5c0da8740f95268757943cce96493d6170193547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/c59f5afa7b311d27edc8f9399ed1845993219d14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66050535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaSharma14","id":66050535,"login":"aaSharma14","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MDUwNTM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaSharma14","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/c59f5afa7b311d27edc8f9399ed1845993219d14","node_id":"C_kwDOQUSWoNoAKGM1OWY1YWZhN2IzMTFkMjdlZGM4ZjkzOTllZDE4NDU5OTMyMTlkMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/e745ac8f0b62077d6d9618442ddb4cc64f67f28b","sha":"e745ac8f0b62077d6d9618442ddb4cc64f67f28b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/e745ac8f0b62077d6d9618442ddb4cc64f67f28b"}],"sha":"c59f5afa7b311d27edc8f9399ed1845993219d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/c59f5afa7b311d27edc8f9399ed1845993219d14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59071?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tchaikov","id":59071,"login":"tchaikov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/b533de73e105dee95af3917b635e808465d47f51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-10T15:01:32Z","email":"k.chai@proxmox.com","name":"Kefu Chai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-11T09:14:03Z","email":"k.chai@proxmox.com","name":"Kefu Chai"},"message":"mgr/dashboard: fix Physical Disks identify test race condition\n\nFix a regression in the Physical Disks identify device e2e test that\ncauses intermittent timeouts when attempting to click the \"Identify\"\nbutton.\n\nProblem:\nThe test was timing out after 120 seconds while attempting to click\nthe \"Identify\" button, which remained in a disabled state. This\nmanifested as a race condition where the test would try to click the\nbutton before it became enabled.\n\nRoot Cause (Regression Analysis):\nThis regression was introduced in commit 94418d90d2b (\"mgr/dashboard:\nfix UI modal issues\", Sept 9, 2024) which aimed to fix the Physical\nDisks Identify modal not opening (tracker.ceph.com/issues/67547).\n\nWhile that commit successfully:\n- Migrated from cd-modal to cds-modal (Carbon Design System)\n- Changed button selector to use data-testid=\"primary-action\"\n- Added the e2e test to prevent future regressions\n\nIt inadvertently introduced a timing issue by not adding proper wait\nlogic for the button to become enabled. The commit also modified the\ntable-actions component to conditionally render the primary action\nbutton based on tableActions.length > 0, which can cause the button\nto be disabled while table actions are still loading.\n\nSolution:\nAdd .should(''not.be.disabled'') before .click() to ensure Cypress waits\nfor the button to become enabled before attempting to interact with it.\nThis follows the established pattern used elsewhere in the codebase\n(see page-helper.po.ts:319).\n\nImpact:\n- Fixes Jenkins build failures in ceph-dashboard-cephadm-e2e job\n- Observed in build #18956 as \"Regression - Failing for 1 build\"\n- Jenkins metrics show MTTF of ~2 hours, indicating this race\n  condition occurs frequently enough to cause CI instability\n\nFixes: https://jenkins.ceph.com/job/ceph-dashboard-cephadm-e2e/18956/testReport/\n\nSigned-off-by: Kefu Chai <k.chai@proxmox.com>","tree":{"sha":"045262aac391c50bc84ca144224c5877d540efeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/045262aac391c50bc84ca144224c5877d540efeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/b533de73e105dee95af3917b635e808465d47f51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59071?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tchaikov","id":59071,"login":"tchaikov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tchaikov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/b533de73e105dee95af3917b635e808465d47f51","node_id":"C_kwDOQUSWoNoAKGI1MzNkZTczZTEwNWRlZTk1YWYzOTE3YjYzNWU4MDg0NjVkNDdmNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/b56fccc902d80f3fea5e8b4b2d7d19cc424f5500","sha":"b56fccc902d80f3fea5e8b4b2d7d19cc424f5500","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/b56fccc902d80f3fea5e8b4b2d7d19cc424f5500"}],"sha":"b533de73e105dee95af3917b635e808465d47f51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/b533de73e105dee95af3917b635e808465d47f51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24204898?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galsalomon66/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galsalomon66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galsalomon66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galsalomon66/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/galsalomon66","id":24204898,"login":"galsalomon66","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjA0ODk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galsalomon66/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galsalomon66/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galsalomon66/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/galsalomon66/starred{/ow