izma@redhat.com","name":"Matan Breizman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T14:53:34Z","email":"mbreizma@redhat.com","name":"Matan Breizman"},"message":"qa/tasks/admin_socket: fix ceph-ci/main usage\n\nWhen scheduling jobs with --sha1 instead of -c. The ceph-ci\nbranch used is ''main''. However, ceph-ci doesn''t actually have\na main branch - Instead use ceph.git main branch.\n\n```\nCommand failed on smithi116 with status 8: \"wget -q -O\n/home/ubuntu/cephtest/admin_socket_client.0/objecter_requests --\n''http://git.ceph.com/?p=ceph-ci.git;a=blob_plain;f=src/test/admin_socket/objecter_requests;hb=main'' && chmod u=rx -- /home/ubuntu/cephtest/admin_socket_client.0/objecter_requests\"\n```\n\nSigned-off-by: Matan Breizman <mbreizma@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"8115bcd972caba8adebe55248aac19aa812b9957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/8115bcd972caba8adebe55248aac19aa812b9957"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/9018618b09530a9067036988c9dde3d01243b538","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63903872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Matan-B","id":63903872,"login":"Matan-B","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTAzODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/subscriptions","type":"User","u