ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/fadb471d521658601896494df506e33796378e96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T08:30:03Z","email":"mbreizma@redhat.com","name":"Matan Breizman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-09T14:53:34Z","email":"mbreizma@redhat.com","name":"Matan Breizman"},"message":"qa/suites/crimson-rados: restructure objectstore dir\n\nThis is a preperation step for addind new backend options\ntesting (e.g caching type)\n\n* move crimson''s objectstore yamls from qa/config to\n  qa/objectstore/crimson\n* Use the entire qa/objectstore/crimson where possible\n  instead of symlinking each backend definition\n\nSee:\n```\n├── objectstore_tool\n│   ├── clusters\n│   ├── crimson-supported-all-distro ->\n.qa/distros/crimson-supported-all-distro/\n│   ├── deploy\n│   ├── objectstore\n│   └── tasks\n├── perf\n│   ├── clusters\n│   ├── crimson-supported-all-distro ->\n.qa/distros/crimson-supported-all-distro/\n│   ├── deploy\n│   ├── objectstore -> .qa/objectstore/crimson\n│   ├── settings\n│   └── workloads\n├── rbd\n│   ├── clusters\n│   ├── crimson-supported-all-distro ->\n.qa/distros/crimson-supported-all-distro/\n│   ├── deploy\n│   ├── objectstore -> .qa/objectstore/crimson\n│   └── tasks\n├── singleton\n│   ├── all\n│   ├── crimson-supported-all-distro ->\n.qa/distros/crimson-supported-all-distro/\n│   └── objectstore -> .qa/objectstore/crimson\n├── thrash\n│   ├── 0-size-min-size-overrides\n│   ├── 1-pg-log-overrides\n│   ├── 2-recovery-overrides\n│   ├── clusters\n│   ├── crimson-supported-all-distro ->\n.qa/distros/crimson-supported-all-distro/\n│   ├── deploy\n│   ├── objectstore\n│   ├── thrashers\n│   └── workloads\n````\n\nSigned-off-by: Matan Breizman <mbreizma@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb3b7f624e6e64a6bbda1f850b1eae77f3d8cabc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/eb3b7f624e6e64a6bbda1f850b1eae77f3d8cabc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/fadb471d521658601896494df506e33796378e96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63903872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Matan-B","id":63903872,"login":"Matan-B","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTAzODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Matan-B","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/fadb471d521658601896494df506e33796378e96","node_id":"C_kwDOQUSWoNoAKGZhZGI0NzFkNTIxNjU4NjAxODk2NDk0ZGY1MDZlMzM3OTYzNzhlOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/27e24a19d8f21aab9c3fe73619492da9a50fe2f7","sha":"27e24a19d8f21aab9c3fe73619492da9a50fe2f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/27e24a19d8f21aab9c3fe73619492da9a50fe2f7"}],"sha":"fadb471d521658601896494df506e33796378e96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/fadb471d521658601896494df506e33796378e96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"