/api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/be99ab3e33df4d33db7b96d0d52a27eba87b4507/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-20T18:33:17Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T13:59:36Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"message":"test/client: When testing large io, consider fscrypt\n\nWhen testing large io sizes and clamping that io, consider\nfscrypt max io size. This max io size should be a multiple\nof 4K (fscrypt block size), but not to exceed INT_MAX.\n\nSigned-off-by: Christopher Hoffman <choffman@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a362a9c7222cf6b62a6cf23cc928ef444776dcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/9a362a9c7222cf6b62a6cf23cc928ef444776dcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/be99ab3e33df4d33db7b96d0d52a27eba87b4507","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/be99ab3e33df4d33db7b96d0d52a27eba87b4507","node_id":"C_kwDOQUSWoNoAKGJlOTlhYjNlMzNkZjRkMzNkYjdiOTZkMGQ1MmEyN2ViYTg3YjQ1MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/ae65b1b3e35c75608348a55b2bfa9d57c691d964","sha":"ae65b1b3e35c75608348a55b2bfa9d57c691d964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/ae65b1b3e35c75608348a55b2bfa9d57c691d964"}],"sha":"be99ab3e33df4d33db7b96d0d52a27eba87b4507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/be99ab3e33df4d33db7b96d0d52a27eba87b4507"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/ae65b1b3e35c75608348a55b2bfa9d57c691d964/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-20T18:15:11Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T13:59:36Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"message":"client: Use nearest fscrypt block when clamping max io size\n\nA max io size can currently be up to INT_MAX. If it is greater,\nthen clamp the size to INT_MAX. This conflicts with fscrypt io\noperations. An fscrypt, op needs to read a whole fscrypt block.\nThe size of fscrypt block size is 4K, INT_MAX % 4K is not equal\nto 0. Therefore, get the nearest multiple of 4K to INT_MAX that\ndoes not go over. In the fscrypt case, this value will be used\nfor clamping max io size.\n\nFixes: https://tracker.ceph.com/issues/73346\nSigned-off-by: Christopher Hoffman <choffman@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"d66acc381e5e2d6fb4d1223c61aa554fb6f2215b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/d66acc381e5e2d6fb4d1223c61aa554fb6f2215b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/ae65b1b3e35c75608348a55b2bfa9d57c691d964","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/ae65b1b3e35c75608348a55b2bfa9d57c691d964","node_id":"C_kwDOQUSWoNoAKGFlNjViMWIzZTM1Yzc1NjA4MzQ4YTU1YjJiZmE5ZDU3YzY5MWQ5NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/72e7040f7f82cd172ab3b27db0551140be9ba3d7","sha":"72e7040f7f82cd172ab3b27db0551140be9ba3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/72e7040f7f82cd172ab3b27db0551140be9ba3d7"}],"sha":"ae65b1b3e35c75608348a55b2bfa9d57c691d964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/ae65b1b3e35c75608348a55b2bfa9d57c691d964"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/72e7040f7f82cd172ab3b27db0551140be9ba3d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-14T14:33:47Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T13:59:36Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"message":"qa: Do not use ec_profile with fscrypt dummy\n\nOnce a volume/filesystem is set to use fscrypt encryption, layout\ncannot be changed. The configurable ec_profile, sets layout and\nwill fail.\n\nFixes: https://tracker.ceph.com/issues/73461\nSigned-off-by: Christopher Hoffman <choffman@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b7a45f75ba4aa7737a34433153940a12d2471cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/1b7a45f75ba4aa7737a34433153940a12d2471cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/72e7040f7f82cd172ab3b27db0551140be9ba3d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/72e7040f7f82cd172ab3b27db0551140be9ba3d7","node_id":"C_kwDOQUSWoNoAKDcyZTcwNDBmN2Y4MmNkMTcyYWIzYjI3ZGIwNTUxMTQwYmU5YmEzZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/cb9c7177e1c9ab9ff889e32fc2a2d01963de11a2","sha":"cb9c7177e1c9ab9ff889e32fc2a2d01963de11a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/cb9c7177e1c9ab9ff889e32fc2a2d01963de11a2"}],"sha":"72e7040f7f82cd172ab3b27db0551140be9ba3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/72e7040f7f82cd172ab3b27db0551140be9ba3d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/cb9c7177e1c9ab9ff889e32fc2a2d01963de11a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-02T14:12:32Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T13:59:36Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"message":"client: Do not expose ceph_fscrypt_key_identifier in api\n\nThe libcephfs API call add_fscrypt_key exposes an internal fscrypt\ndata structure. This is because a hash keyid (of the master key) is used\nfor calls such as remove_fscrypt_key. Instead of using this structure,\nuse a char array to obtain keyid.\n\nFixes: https://tracker.ceph.com/issues/63293\nSigned-off-by: Christopher Hoffman <choffman@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"98ed14c0cd83f6059c69e949b9f1ff0bc1d59881","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/98ed14c0cd83f6059c69e949b9f1ff0bc1d59881"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/cb9c7177e1c9ab9ff889e32fc2a2d01963de11a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/cb9c7177e1c9ab9ff889e32fc2a2d01963de11a2","node_id":"C_kwDOQUSWoNoAKGNiOWM3MTc3ZTFjOWFiOWZmODg5ZTMyZmMyYTJkMDE5NjNkZTExYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Xoagan/ceph/commit/cefaafd1ce3a88b10c3f512be1ab82c1357c846e","sha":"cefaafd1ce3a88b10c3f512be1ab82c1357c846e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/cefaafd1ce3a88b10c3f512be1ab82c1357c846e"}],"sha":"cb9c7