/chrisphoffman","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/commits/590cfe86468d5b052a4289d4253cf509f0165edd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-29T14:02:32Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T13:59:36Z","email":"choffman@redhat.com","name":"Christopher Hoffman"},"message":"client: During fscrypt get policy do not display inbuf\n\nWhen calling get encryption policy via ioctl, do not display\nthe hex str of inbuf. This buffer is not used/uninitialized\nso no need to display.\n\nSigned-off-by: Christopher Hoffman <choffman@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc5429182b947e7deab84ac08b8df08486bd9e46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/fc5429182b947e7deab84ac08b8df08486bd9e46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/590cfe86468d5b052a4289d4253cf509f0165edd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chri