 in client\n\nFix warnings/errors in ceph API tests that are present in various files\nthat were introduced by fscrypt feature\n\nsrc/client/FSCrypt.cc:90:6: error: variable ''olen'' set but not used [-Werror,-Wunused-but-set-variable]\n   90 |         int olen = 0;\n      |             ^\nsrc/client/FSCrypt.cc:91:6: error: variable ''line'' set but not used [-Werror,-Wunused-but-set-variable]\n   91 |         int line = 0;\n      |             ^\nsrc/client/FSCrypt.cc:945:2: error: is this the way to do it? [-Werror,-W#warnings]\n  945 | #warning is this the way to do it?\nsrc/client/Client.cc:11850:2: error: read holes [-Werror,-W#warnings]\n 11850 | #warning read holes\n       |  ^\nsrc/client/Client.cc:11855:2: error: implement file read here [-Werror,-W#warnings]\n 11855 | #warning implement file read here\n       |  ^\nsrc/client/Inode.cc:847:2: error: need to make sure that we do not skip entire subtree somehow [-Werror,-W#warnings]\n  847 | #warning need to make sure that we do not skip entire subtree somehow\n      |  ^\n\nSigned-off-by: Christopher Hoffman <choffman@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bf7bfe1ff167de91fbe8e8f93cfbf7830f9768c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/trees/9bf7bfe1ff167de91fbe8e8f93cfbf7830f9768c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Xoagan/ceph/git/commits/ee9096686e41a7a6c57f39782ef3ade681babb0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85690783?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisphoffman/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisphoffman","id":85690783,"login":"chrisphoffman","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjkwNzgz","organizat