/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/18ea98f6090d9450c399654718949f24a76adf6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T02:21:41Z","email":"52720291+jeffcrosley@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeff Crosley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T02:21:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dashboard): MCP session health, dispatches time filter, active/pending display (#39)\n\n- getMcpSessionId now pings before reusing a cached session so stale sessions\n  after personal-mcp Render redeploys are detected and re-initialized\n- mcpCall logs non-ok responses to console.error for Render log visibility\n- GET /api/dispatches gains ?since_hours= (default 24h) to filter old history\n- Dashboard fetches ?since_hours=24 on load; subtitle updated to \"Recent activity\"\n- Running filter renamed \"Active\" and now includes pending sessions\n- isStale marks running sessions >2h or pending sessions >10min as stale\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24e112d38138b1157974b84d2f120be389eb39de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/trees/24e112d38138b1157974b84d2f120be389eb39de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/commits/18ea98f6090d9450c399654718949f24a76adf6d","verification":{"payload":"tree 24e112d38138b1157974b84d2f120be389eb39de\nparent da5d419bbba39283b7bc8e2f24a6f212122427f0\nauthor Jeff Crosley <52720291+jeffcrosley@users.noreply.github.com> 1780971701 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780971701 -0400\n\nfix(dashboard): MCP session health, dispatches time filter, active/pending display (#39)\n\n- getMcpSessionId now pings before reusing a cached session so stale sessions\n  after personal-mcp Render redeploys are detected and re-initialized\n- mcpCall logs non-ok responses to console.error for Render log visibility\n- GET /api/dispatches gains ?since_hours= (default 24h) to filter old history\n- Dashboard fetches ?since_hours=24