"2026-06-08T21:45:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(dashboard): add Open MRs widget with live status from GitHub/GitLab (#38)\n\nAdds a new \"Open MRs\" section between Available Work and Inbox on the\ndashboard. Backend GET /api/mrs fetches live status (draft/open/merged/closed)\nand pipeline pass/fail for each configured MR using GITHUB_TOKEN /\nGITLAB_TOKEN; results are cached 60s. Frontend groups MRs by feature label,\ncollapses merged by default, and shows status pills + pipeline indicators.\nSeed list pre-populated with today''s open jeffapp PRs and AIA CI/CD MRs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3373c2f6b3d737b85fc4cb51619038c90185c192","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/trees/3373c2f6b3d737b85fc4cb51619038c90185c192"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/commits/da5d419bbba39283b7bc8e2f24a6f212122427f0","verification":{"payload":"tree 3373c2f6b3d737b85fc4cb51619038c90185c192\nparent ff563652e4c3adbfd58558fddb71ae27fbd1b20a\nauthor Jeff Crosley <52720291+jeffcrosley@users.noreply.github.com> 1780955147 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780955147 -0400\n\nfeat(dashboard): add Open MRs widget with live status from GitHub/GitLab (#38)\n\nAdds a new \"Open MRs\" section between Available Work and Inbox on the\ndashboard. Backend GET /api/mrs fetches live status (draft/open/merged/closed)\nand pipeline pass/fail for each configured MR using GITHUB_TOKEN /\nGITLAB_TOKEN; results are cached 60s. Frontend groups MRs by feature label,\ncollapses merged by default, and shows status pills + pipeline indicators.\nSeed list pre-populated with today''s open jeffapp PRs and AIA CI/CD MRs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJzgLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArVgQAHER3UbS76EvsgfuopVv7x3t\nP9zGgcrbCt8Gy4DT60WzH/gfGlmnWeyjE0CWR+SBYzzw8Fu4omKMCObq0P