27fbd1b20a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/ff563652e4c3adbfd58558fddb71ae27fbd1b20a"}],"sha":"da5d419bbba39283b7bc8e2f24a6f212122427f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/da5d419bbba39283b7bc8e2f24a6f212122427f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52720291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffcrosley","id":52720291,"login":"jeffcrosley","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzIwMjkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/ff563652e4c3adbfd58558fddb71ae27fbd1b20a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T21:43:11Z","email":"52720291+jeffcrosley@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeff Crosley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T21:43:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dashboard): SSE payload fix, refresh reconciliation, MCP error handling (#37)\n\n* feat(dashboard): persist active filter, add stale card indicator\n\n- activeFilter now reads from localStorage on init and writes back on\n  change, so the selected filter survives page refreshes\n- Cards with status=running and created_at >120 min ago get card-stale\n  class (muted border + reduced opacity) and a small \"stale?\" badge next\n  to the timestamp, making ghost dispatches visually distinct\n\nFix 2 (inbox parsing) was already correct on main — extractMcpText was\nin place from the original feature commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dashboard): SSE payload parsing, card refresh reconciliation, MCP error handling\n\n- Fix SSE event handler: stage lives on the outer event envelope, not\n  inside event.data. Route on event.type instead of checking data fields;\n  merge outer stage + derive status from event type before calling\n  handleLifecycleEvent.\n- Add SSE cache (Map) so cards updated via SSE survive the next R2 fetch;\n  loadDispatches merges cached stage/status over stale R2 state and keeps\n  SSE-only sessions that haven''t been written to R2 yet.\n- Inbox (GET /api/gtd/inbox): catch MCP session expiry and return\n  { items: [], error: ''unavailable'' } with 200 instead of 502; UI shows\n  ''Inbox unavailable''.\n- Work (GET /api/gtd/work): add 5s timeout via Promise.race; on timeout\n  or error return { projects: [], ungrouped: [], error: ''unavailable'' }\n  with 200; UI shows ''Tasks unavailable — MCP session may have expired''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12ce069b8516ae1cf246b9c87f2fbf60f745e2a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/trees/12ce069b8516ae1cf246b9c87f2fbf60f745e2a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/commits/ff563652e4c3adbfd58558fddb71ae27fbd1b20a","verification":{"payload":"tree 12ce069b8516ae1cf246b9c87f2fbf60f745e2a8\nparent c8175e0b20a316bbf3e008da1bbf59e7a450bc52\nauthor Jeff Crosley <52720291+jeffcrosley@users.noreply.github.com> 1780954991 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780954991 -0400\n\nfix(dashboard): SSE payload fix, refresh reconciliation, MCP error handling (#37)\n\n* feat(dashboard): persist active filter, add stale card indicator\n\n- activeFilter now reads from localStorage on init and writes back on\n  change, so the selected filter survives page refreshes\n- Cards with status=running and created_at >120 min ago get card-stale\n  class (muted border + reduced opacity) and a small \"stale?\" badge next\n  to the timestamp, making ghost dispatches visually distinct\n\nFix 2 (inbox parsing) was already correct on main — extractMcpText was\nin place from the original feature commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dashboard): SSE payload parsing, card refresh reconciliation, MCP error handling\n\n- Fix SSE event handler: stage lives on the outer event envelope, not\n  inside event.data. Route on event.type instead of checking data fields;\n  merge outer stage + derive status from event type before calling\n  handleLifecycleEvent.\n- Add SSE cache (Map) so cards updated via SSE survive the next R2 fetch;\n  loadDispatches merges cached stage/status over stale R2 state and keeps\n  SSE-only sessions that haven''t been written to R2 yet.\n- Inbox (GET /api/gtd/inbox): catch MCP session expiry and return\n  { items: [], error: ''unavailable'' } with 200 instead of 502; UI shows\n  ''Inbox unavailable''.\n- Work (GET /api/gtd/work): add 5s timeout via Promise.race; on timeout\n  or error return { projects: [], ungrouped: [], error: ''unavailable'' }\n  with 200; UI shows ''Tasks unavailable — MCP session may have expired''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJzdvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+5oQAF+IQ826HxIAP3MJz45LguZ+\nmlQVX277/dmBRFIABbc3D2TqsS0Nmt7JcKGvkO8oTrm9EfmwRPj+bDJw1IuVuTVe\nGIW6MBPVgOqNumCkjiJEqIccm87CIB5LP8HT+OLuMXYETm3F7RPl3wXPssRxbKAR\nRpltIlrbPmmU8NL77gvLie3eG1HHcc1Py/64FX3iUregDtWeVy/IX90NVELUM5uL\n0PDJHB