il.com","name":"Jeff Crosley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:46:03Z","email":"jeffcrosley@gmail.com","name":"Jeff Crosley"},"message":"fix: cap briefs at 10 most recent; remove hardcoded localhost:3333 fallback\n\n/api/gtd/briefs now sorts by filename date prefix (descending) and slices\nto 10 before fetching file contents, eliminating N+1 MCP round-trips on\nlarge brief directories.\n\nDEFAULT_DEV_CONFIG.apiGatewayUrl changed from ''http://localhost:3333'' to\n'''' so the auth service no longer fires a visibly-failing request before\nconfig.json loads on production.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78757e16065c3d6a32f42d4b5cbaa2c5f32de11b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/trees/78757e16065c3d6a32f42d4b5cbaa2c5f32de11b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/commits/58d4016a0d20e641c04cfe7257d9f5cbdb031660","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52720291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffcrosley","id":52720291,"login":"jeffcrosley","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNzIwMjkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley