effcrosley/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffcrosley","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/e86d157d7041d5babeb202c2622307ada264e088/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:02:35Z","email":"52720291+jeffcrosley@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeff Crosley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:02:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(nav-shell): live dispatch session steppers with SSE auto-update\n\nReplaces the flat dispatch list with a horizontal per-session stepper\nshowing the 5-stage lifecycle (dispatched → started → executing →\nreturn_written → complete), advancing in real-time via SSE events on\nthe jeff:dispatch channel. Failed stages shown in red. Agent glyphs\n(♄ ♆ ♂ ☿ ♃) identify which planet owns each session.\n\nEventBusService gains connected$ (BehaviorSubject) and channel\npropagation on each event, enabling the reconnecting indicator.\nDashboard spec gains EventBusService mock to fix a pre-existing\nEventSource-undefined failure in the jsdom test environment.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f68cc160900ff0ddc56d1ca32fbdc9cf37d10b04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/trees/f68cc160900ff0ddc56d1ca32fbdc9cf37d10b04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/commits/e86d157d7041d5babeb202c2622307ada264e088","verification":{"payload":"tree f68cc160900ff0ddc56d1ca32fbdc9cf37d10b04\nparent 461c585719633c5b5d92bc139aecbfba2112bffc\nauthor Jeff Crosley <52720291+jeffcrosley@users.noreply.github.com> 1780930955 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780930955 -0400\n\nfeat(nav-shell): live dispatch session steppers with SSE auto-update\n\