/jeffapp/commits/0d236d4871f06e984aa1210ffcd890dec93b970a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T14:49:59Z","email":"jeffcrosley@gmail.com","name":"Jeff Crosley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T14:49:59Z","email":"jeffcrosley@gmail.com","name":"Jeff Crosley"},"message":"fix: auth UX polish for alpha launch\n\n- Gate all routes (home, about, components, contact) with authGuard\n- Save return URL to sessionStorage before login redirect; restore via\n  function-based redirectTo on empty path so post-login lands on the\n  originally requested page (or /traffic-light by default)\n- Add APP_INITIALIZER for checkAuth() so isLoggedIn signal is set at\n  boot — logout button in nav drawer now shows on all pages\n- Fix root cause of broken traffic-light page: StatusApiService was\n  sending OidcAuthService bearer tokens (null after BFF login); switch\n  to session-cookie auth (credentials: include) throughout\n- Add requireAuth to gateway jwt.ts — session-first, JWT bearer fallback\n  — so status routes accept BFF session without needing a client token\n- TrafficLightPage.logout() now calls AuthService.logout() (BFF session\n  teardown + Authentik end-session) instead of OidcAuthService.logout()\n- AuthCallbackComponent handles error query param with user-friendly\n  messages instead of silent redirect; BFF error redirects now target\n  /auth/callback so the component can display them\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f7a72571c76a353575828857f19ee8efee7f1de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/trees/5f7a72571c76a353575828857f19ee8efee7f1de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/commits/0d236d4871f06e984aa1210ffcd890dec93b970a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52720291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users