rl":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commit/b2a077a4ba0c44764787c78584fe071d680321ba","node_id":"C_kwDOQUfgwNoAKGIyYTA3N2E0YmEwYzQ0NzY0Nzg3Yzc4NTg0ZmUwNzFkNjgwMzIxYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commit/f4aa0a1344bd1d988f2b125b9e216321dbd84205","sha":"f4aa0a1344bd1d988f2b125b9e216321dbd84205","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/f4aa0a1344bd1d988f2b125b9e216321dbd84205"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commit/d1f4cd1b8c1d67377f2196e2bb2ba6c9ee08aaa1","sha":"d1f4cd1b8c1d67377f2196e2bb2ba6c9ee08aaa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/d1f4cd1b8c1d67377f2196e2bb2ba6c9ee08aaa1"}],"sha":"b2a077a4ba0c44764787c78584fe071d680321ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/b2a077a4ba0c44764787c78584fe071d680321ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commits/d1f4cd1b8c1d67377f2196e2bb2ba6c9ee08aaa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T18:55:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T18:55:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: brief task hydration, dashboard error display, ESLint cleanup\n\n1. /api/gtd/briefs: read each brief file with fs_read_file, parse task IDs\n   from \"- Task IDs: task_YYYYMMDD_NNN\" in ## Context, hydrate {id,title,status}\n   via gtd_get_task. Tasks not found in the store are omitted.\n\n2. Dashboard hot-projects: tasksError was set on fetch failure but never\n   displayed, causing \"No recently active projects.\" to appear when the API\n   call had actually failed. Now mirrors the briefs section error pattern.\n\n3. api-gateway ESLint: cleared all 26 pre-existing warnings by adding\n   express-session SessionData augmentation, replacing req.session casts,\n   fixing non-null assertions on env vars, and typing express middleware\n   parameters in test mocks.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WKQR8Cp8NZw5HBUc1ECr3t","tree":{"sha":"967d4062675b1b5477904ec91435034f05c99a32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/trees/967d4062675b1b5477904ec91435034f05c99a32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/commits/d1f4cd1b8c1d67377f2196e2bb2ba6c9ee08aaa1","verification":{"payload":"tree 967d4062675b1b5477904ec91435034f05c99a32\nparent f4aa0a1344bd1d988f2b125b9e216321dbd84205\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778871308 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778871308 +0000\n\nfix: brief task hydration, dashboard error display, ESLint cleanup\n\n1. /api/gtd/briefs: read each brief file with fs_read_file, parse task IDs\n   from \"- Task IDs: task_YYYYMMDD_NNN\" in ## Context, hydrate {id,title,status}\n   via gtd_get_task. Tasks not found in the store are omitted.\n\n2. Dashboard hot-projects: tasksError was set on fetch failure but never\n   displayed, causing \"No recently active projects.\" to appear when the API\n   call had actually failed. Now mirrors the briefs section error pattern.\n\n3. api-gateway ESLint: cleared all 26 pre-existing warnings by adding\n   express-session SessionData augmentation, replacing req.session casts,\n   fixing non-null assertions on env vars, and typing express middleware\n   parameters in test mocks.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01WKQR8Cp8NZw5HBUc1ECr3t\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCLYpBAt\nsAtyk1dhvJF3wegx8ij9UYjlKEWWVpDYnP2J4hnh7Ks0Nirqj9LtJJYMxdKP3QrEPb/0uKb8RlnI\ngAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-15T18:55:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/commit/d1f4cd1b8c1d67377f2196e2bb2ba6c9ee08aaa1","node_id":"C_kwDOQUfgwNoAKGQxZjRjZDFiOGMxZDY3Mzc3ZjIxOTZlMmJiMmJhNmM5ZWUwOGFhYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github