XBj3sWZ3i58sbhwGgF","tree":{"sha":"3466519acaaebf0ba8f552114ac2ee2dcde600ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/trees/3466519acaaebf0ba8f552114ac2ee2dcde600ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeffcrosleyorg/jeffapp/git/commits/be2741e1b93fbc85df8e1ad9d359d2d7b04946de","verification":{"payload":"tree 3466519acaaebf0ba8f552114ac2ee2dcde600ab\nparent d423601acdb3e5c6a21d7f61dca3c0883c0ddbc3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777894311 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1777894311 +0000\n\nfix(api-gateway): parse SSE response from MCP server instead of calling .json()\n\nThe MCP server returns text/event-stream format. Calling resp.json() on\nan SSE body throws \"Unexpected token ''e''...\" which is the actual 502 cause.\n\nAdds parseMcpResponse() which checks Content-Type and extracts the JSON\npayload from the ''data:'' line when the response is SSE, falling back to\nresp.json() for plain JSON responses.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01JbCYXBj3sWZ3i58sbhwGgF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI7vKJwe\niyGDY6x27/3CvIfAx8O1U/N4RMNE6NnS/JjcnjlibsMtxsnO6tj6U4HayKhCekRVeag8xezMTjP0\n3QI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-04T11:31:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claud