 using native knn queries\n\n- Replace script_score with native OpenSearch knn query for semantic search\n- Implement hybrid search using bool query with should clauses\n- All three search modes (BM25, semantic, hybrid) now working correctly\n- Semantic search uses cosine similarity via knn vector field\n- Hybrid search combines BM25 text matching with vector similarity using configurable weights","tree":{"sha":"7e955e113fa0ee74a36ce6b564d2ae1e9a84a9e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KavinRajagopal/internal_search/git/trees/7e955e113fa0ee74a36ce6b564d2ae1e9a84a9e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KavinRajagopal/internal_search/git/commits/176937dd5313fcdfeaed585727ff9109e1a3f4aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104757102?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KavinRajagopal","id":104757102,"login":"KavinRajagopal","node_id":"U_kgDOBj53bg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KavinRajagopal/internal_search/commit/176937dd5313fcdfeaed585727ff9109e1a3f4aa","node_id":"C_kwDOQUlGd9oAKDE3NjkzN2RkNTMxM2ZjZGZlYWVkNTg1NzI3ZmY5MTA5ZTF