odes: bm25, semantic, hybrid\n- BM25: Traditional keyword-based search (TF-IDF ranking)\n- Semantic: Vector similarity using cosine similarity on embeddings\n- Hybrid: Weighted combination of BM25 + semantic scores\n- Configurable weights for hybrid mode (bm25_weight, vector_weight)\n- Updated API to v2.0.0 with enhanced docs\n- Added search_type parameter to GET and POST endpoints\n- Updated README with examples for all three search modes","tree":{"sha":"80d05584d529db4f2089c5985781d9f31a8787ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KavinRajagopal/internal_search/git/trees/80d05584d529db4f2089c5985781d9f31a8787ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KavinRajagopal/internal_search/git/commits/23bf26758cba7cf56a26f8629b4731eec79c807f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104757102?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KavinRajagopal","id":104757102,"login":"KavinRajagopal","node_id":"U_kgDOBj53bg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KavinRajagopal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KavinRajagopal/internal_search/commit/23bf26758cba7cf56a26f8629b4731eec79c807f","node_id":"C_kwDOQUlGd9oAKDI