a133/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T16:03:35Z","email":"petarnenovpetrov@gmail.com","name":"Petar Nenov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T16:03:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #1 from petarnenov/asset-platform-mfe-architecture\n\nAsset platform mfe architecture","tree":{"sha":"3eb42bca27a16ff566b4ea441a3fd5d0018ca705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/git/trees/3eb42bca27a16ff566b4ea441a3fd5d0018ca705"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/git/commits/3af024d1310421d82a0ee91c0c7f7d845942a133","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov/fullstack/commit/3af024d1310421d82a0ee91c0c7f7d845942a133","node_id":"C_kwDOQUmlDdoAKDNhZjAyNGQxMzEwNDIxZDgyYTBlZTkxYzBjN2Y3ZDg0NTk0MmExMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov/fullstack/commit/1d978db5dbe74dac54ce0838729d866fcd4d969b","sha":"1d978db5dbe74dac54ce0838729d866fcd4d969b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/commits/1d978db5dbe74dac54ce0838729d866fcd4d969b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov/fullstack/commit/353c917af38884842f9bca85ecd8ff9e5e82cac8","sha":"353c917af38884842f9bca85ecd8ff9e5e82cac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/commits/353c917af38884842f9bca85ecd8ff9e5e82cac8"}],"sha":"3af024d1310421d82a0ee91c0c7f7d845942a133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/commits/3af024d1310421d82a0ee91c0c7f7d845942a133"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9674083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov","id":9674083,"login":"petarnenov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NzQwODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/commits/353c917af38884842f9bca85ecd8ff9e5e82cac8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T15:59:44Z","email":"petarnenovpetrov@gmail.com","name":"Petar Nenov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T15:59:44Z","email":"petarnenovpetrov@gmail.com","name":"Petar Nenov"},"message":"feat: Add shell-owned auth + Trading MFE\n\nTwo load-bearing additions to the POC:\n\n1. Basic auth, owned end-to-end by the shell.\n   - @amp/api gains a new auth domain (hardcoded demo users, opaque\n     in-memory session tokens, Bearer middleware on /api/billing/* and\n     /api/accounts/*). A demo-only GET /api/auth/demo-credentials\n     powers the login page autofill — would not ship in prod.\n   - platform-shell owns AuthContext (login/logout/bootstrap-from-me,\n     localStorage persistence, queryClient.invalidate on identity\n     change), ProtectedRoute wrapping every non-login route, and a\n     login page with three demo credentials clickable to autofill.\n   - Each MFE''s axios instance reads the token from a minimal\n     window.__AMP_PLATFORM__ SDK at request time and dispatches\n     \"amp:auth-expired\" on 401. The shell listens and forces logout.\n     Contract surface = one object shape + one event name; duplicated\n     inline per MFE on purpose so there is zero build-time coupling.\n     Federation-exposed SDK or import maps are the production upgrade.\n\n2. New Trading team + MFE (violet team color, port 5176).\n   - @amp/api gains a trading domain: symbols, positions, orders,\n     portfolio summary. Market orders fill instantly at the seeded\n     lastPrice; sells exceeding held quantity return 409 rejected.\n   - New @amp/mfe-trading exposes ./TradingPage (symbol list, order\n     ticket, positions, order history) and ./PortfolioWidget\n     (dashboard tile). Independent generated API client.\n   - Shell: new /trading route, sidebar nav entry, 4th dashboard\n     tile, TeamBadge \"trading\" variant, shell-side team-color tokens\n     (light + dark). Remote registered in vite.config.\n\nBonus: packages/api/src/index.ts now has a SIGINT/SIGTERM handler\nthat closes keep-alive sockets and exits under 2s — no more \"tsx\nProcess didn''t exit in 5s. Force killing…\" spam when Ctrl+C''ing dev.\nRoot dev script gets concurrently''s -k flag so one crash takes the\nwhole stack down cleanly.\n\nTests: 26 Jest tests pass across 4 domains (auth, billing, accounts,\ntrading). Docs updated: ARCHITECTURE (auth diagram + 4-team map +\ntrading section), DEMO_SCRIPT (new 3-min auth segment + 4 dashboard\ntiles + 3 lazy imports), CLAUDE (new load-bearing constraint #6 for\nauth ownership), README (4-team table).","tree":{"sha":"3eb42bca27a16ff566b4ea441a3fd5d0018ca705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/git/trees/3eb42bca27a16ff566b4ea441a3fd5d0018ca705"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/git/commits/353c917af38884842f9bca85ecd8ff9e5e82cac8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9674083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov","id":9674083,"login":"petarnenov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NzQwODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov/fullstack/commit/353c917af38884842f9bca85ecd8ff9e5e82cac8","node_id":"C_kwDOQUmlDdoAKDM1M2M5MTdhZjM4ODg0ODQyZjliY2E4NWVjZDhmZjllNWU4MmNhYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov/fullstack/commit/e67ff3fb4b223650e4e2a690f00d870c7a8a5fb4","sha":"e67ff3fb4b223650e4e2a690f00d870c7a8a5fb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/commits/e67ff3fb4b223650e4e2a690f00d870c7a8a5fb4"}],"sha":"353c917af38884842f9bca85ecd8ff9e5e82cac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/commits/353c917af38884842f9bca85ecd8ff9e5e82cac8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9674083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov","id":9674083,"login":"petarnenov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NzQwODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/commits/e67ff3fb4b223650e4e2a690f00d870c7a8a5fb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T15:24:18Z","email":"petarnenovpetrov@gmail.com","name":"Petar Nenov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T15:24:18Z","email":"petarnenovpetrov@gmail.com","name":"Petar Nenov"},"message":"refactor: Reshape monorepo as team-owned MFE POC with theme support\n\nReplace the generic Users/Products/Orders scaffold with an\nasset-management platform modelled on three independent teams\n(Platform Core / Billing / Open Account) so the repo can drive\na 30-minute Module Federation demo.\n\nPackages:\n- backend → @amp/api: Express split by domain (billing, accounts),\n  in-memory only (dropped SQLite + repository-factory complexity).\n- frontend → @amp/platform-shell: host with Dashboard composing\n  widgets from both remotes, auth stub, MfeBoundary, team badges.\n- micro-frontend → @amp/mfe-open-account: exposes OpenAccountPage\n  and OnboardingProgressWidget.\n- new @amp/mfe-billing: exposes BillingPage and\n  OutstandingBalanceWidget (port 5175).\n\nShared singletons (react, react-dom, @tanstack/react-query) let a\nmutation in one MFE invalidate the cache that a widget in another\nMFE — or the shell Dashboard — reads from.\n\nTheme:\n- data-theme attribute on <html>, owned by shell ThemeContext\n  (light / dark / system + localStorage persistence).\n- Shared CSS-variable token set duplicated across shell and both\n  MFE index.css files so tokens work standalone and inherit in\n  composed mode. All CSS modules reference var(--token) only.\n- ThemeToggle in sidebar; tri-state segmented control in Settings.\n\nDocs: 13 stale root *.md files consolidated into ARCHITECTURE.md,\nDEMO_SCRIPT.md (30-min walkthrough), and a rewritten README.\nCLAUDE.md updated for the new layout.","tree":{"sha":"2a6189d1f7b6154a3ea1781b99222ab5b243193f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/git/trees/2a6189d1f7b6154a3ea1781b99222ab5b243193f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/git/commits/e67ff3fb4b223650e4e2a690f00d870c7a8a5fb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9674083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/petarnenov","id":9674083,"login":"petarnenov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NzQwODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/orgs","received_e