6VXNlcjk2NzQwODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/petarnenov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/petarnenov/fullstack/commits/1e4671f63402949dc02de3bd1fea88a1dcd3f78f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T01:38:29Z","email":"petarnenovpetrov@gmail.com","name":"Petar Nenov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T01:38:29Z","email":"petarnenovpetrov@gmail.com","name":"Petar Nenov"},"message":"refactor: Convert all frontend styles to CSS Modules\n\nConvert App and all page components to use scoped CSS Modules:\n\nFrontend changes:\n- Rename App.css → App.module.css\n- Convert all class names from kebab-case to camelCase:\n  * .tab-content → .tabContent\n  * .data-grid → .dataGrid\n  * .form-section → .formSection\n  * .form-group → .formGroup\n  * All other classes updated to camelCase\n\nUpdated components to import and use CSS Modules:\n- App.tsx: Import styles from \"./App.module.css\"\n- UsersTab.tsx: Use styles from \"../App.module.css\"\n- OrdersTab.tsx: Use styles from \"../App.module.css\"\n- ProductsTab.tsx: Use styles from \"../App.module.css\"\n- TypeExamplesPage.tsx: Use styles from \"../App.module.css\"\n\nAll components now use scoped class names via styles object:\n- className={styles.tabContent}\n- className={styles.dataGrid}\n- className={`${styles.badge} ${styles.success}`}\n\nBenefits:\n- Complete CSS encapsulation in both host and micro-frontend\n- No global CSS conflicts\n- Consistent styling architecture across entire monorepo\n- Production-ready with scoped, hashed class names","tree":{"sha":"9a