Ductus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-regel-rtf-manuell-fe/commits/2bf04935fe287ca87b31779046971c1116eca13a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:23:12Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:38:22Z","email":"lisa.wedin@ductus.se","name":"LisaWedin_Ductus"},"message":"fix: namespace the runtime-config global per app\n\nwindow._env_ was shared across every FE app. Module Federation loads\nthis remote into the shell''s browser window, so the shell''s\nruntime-config.js clobbered this app''s own, and it ended up resolving\nthe shell''s BFF URL instead of its own (rtf-manuell-bff). Renames to\nwindow.__RTF_MANUELL_FE_ENV__.","tree":{"sha":"3e165cf268cb0eb9e7344ff77f9f7663a1b26b69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-regel-rtf-manuell-fe/git/trees/3e165cf268cb0eb9e7344ff77f9f7663a1b26b69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Forsakringskassan/rimfrost-regel-rtf-manuell-fe/git/commits/2bf04935fe287ca87b31779046971c1116eca13a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242170731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LisaWedin-Ductus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LisaWedin-Ductus","id":242170731,"login":"LisaWedin-Ductus","node_id":"U