-capable Twilio\n  numbers (no free-text); added a \"To numbers\" textarea (paste, one per line)\n  alongside the existing leads toggle.\n- api-client smsAPI: testCredentials, attach/get/update/delete integration,\n  listSmsNumbers, configureNumberWebhook, sendTest.\n- Nav + routes: add Settings and Test entries; dashboard getting-started updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"294d6b4c68b4d4be80a7d96fd62914607cf3b72c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coding1100/Appointment-Setter-Frontend/git/trees/294d6b4c68b4d4be80a7d96fd62914607cf3b72c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coding1100/Appointment-Setter-Frontend/git/commits/8ed96ab5ff5ced1daa462acbbbc0c9bef6d1df3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177192792?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/coding1100","id":177192792,"login":"coding1100","node_id":"U_kgDOCo-_WA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coding1100","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coding1100/Appointment-Setter-Frontend/commit/8ed96ab5ff5ced1daa462acbbbc0c9bef6d1df3a","node_id":"C_kwDOQU5_ANoAKDhlZDk2YWI1ZmY1Y2VkMWRhYTQ2MmFjYmJiYzBjOWJlZjZkM