lowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commit/2e69160e016f71b3c9c32995ed178af0c6c41929","node_id":"C_kwDOQU7UbNoAKDJlNjkxNjBlMDE2ZjcxYjNjOWMzMjk5NWVkMTc4YWYwYzZjNDE5Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commit/513aef16b0f5da65f022dbcf70518ce4f1987af4","sha":"513aef16b0f5da65f022dbcf70518ce4f1987af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/513aef16b0f5da65f022dbcf70518ce4f1987af4"}],"sha":"2e69160e016f71b3c9c32995ed178af0c6c41929","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/2e69160e016f71b3c9c32995ed178af0c6c41929"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/513aef16b0f5da65f022dbcf70518ce4f1987af4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T19:39:47Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T19:39:47Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"message":"Add Compounding Engineering documentation system\n\nImplemented complete Compounding Engineering system to multiply developer productivity by documenting architectural decisions, failures, data quirks, and integrations for future developers and AI agents.\n\nKey Changes:\n\nNew Files (8):\n- FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md: Universal AI agent entry point (12 KB)\n- DOCUMENTATION_MAP.md: Navigation guide (5 KB)\n- docs/COMPOUNDING_GUIDE.md: Complete system guide (19 KB)\n- docs/README_COMPOUNDING.md: Quick reference (6 KB)\n- docs/decisions/000-template.md: ADR template (2.8 KB)\n- docs/failures/000-template.md: Failure log template (3.8 KB)\n- docs/data-quirks/000-template.md: Data quirk template (4.4 KB)\n- docs/integrations/000-template.md: Integration template (7.5 KB)\n\nNew Directories (4):\n- docs/decisions/: Architecture Decision Records\n- docs/failures/: Lessons learned from mistakes\n- docs/data-quirks/: Non-obvious data behavior docs\n- docs/integrations/: External API/service integration docs\n\nModified (2):\n- README.md: Added ''For AI Coding Agents'' section\n- docs/AI_AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md: Added auto-compounding triggers\n\nRemoved (2):\n- AI_AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md (root): Duplicate removed\n- QUICK_START_FOR_AI.md: Superseded by FOR-AI-CODING-AGENTS.md\n\nThe 4 Document Types:\n1. ADRs: Document WHY architectural choices were made\n2. Failure Logs: Document mistakes to prevent repetition\n3. Data Quirks: Document non-obvious data behavior\n4. Integration Docs: Document external API/service integrations\n\nROI: Developer 1 documents mistake (6.25h), Developers 2-N read doc and fix correctly (0.5h each). Savings: 60% time reduction on repeated issues.\n\nAI agents now auto-document when making decisions, discovering quirks, hitting errors, or integrating systems.\n\nCompound knowledge: Each documented item multiplies productivity for future developers and AI agents.","tree":{"sha":"4550e1ba85cef7016c9d52b6217a53ad952a47b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/trees/4550e1ba85cef7016c9d52b6217a53ad952a47b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/commits/513aef16b0f5da65f022dbcf70518ce4f1987af4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commit/513aef16b0f5da65f022dbcf70518ce4f1987af4","node_id":"C_kwDOQU7UbNoAKDUxM2FlZjE2YjBmNWRhNjVmMDIyZGJjZjcwNTE4Y2U0ZjE5ODdhZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commit/f789bff27aff2e7b06a2d12a94125b18df443ad8","sha":"f789bff27aff2e7b06a2d12a94125b18df443ad8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/f789bff27aff2e7b06a2d12a94125b18df443ad8"}],"sha":"513aef16b0f5da65f022dbcf70518ce4f1987af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/513aef16b0f5da65f022dbcf70518ce4f1987af4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/f789bff27aff2e7b06a2d12a94125b18df443ad8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T16:50:45Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T16:50:45Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"message":"Docs: Add critical Settings and PluginState requirements\n\nComprehensive documentation update for SERVICE_BRIDGES.md to prevent common errors.\n\n**Settings Service - Critical Updates:**\n- Added prominent warning: All settings MUST be registered in lifecycle_manager.py\n- Added Step 1: Register Settings section with complete Python example\n- Documented settingDefinitions structure (id, name, type, default, category, scope)\n- Added supported types: boolean, string, number, object, array\n- Added Common Errors section with solutions\n- Updated Key Points with registration requirement as #1 item\n\n**PluginState Service - New Section Added:**\n- Complete PluginState Service documentation (previously missing)\n- Added prominent warning: Must call configure() before any state operations\n- Added Step 1: Configure on Component Mount with full example\n- Documented configuration options (pluginId, stateStrategy, preserveKeys, stateSchema, maxStateSize)\n- Added Step 2: Using with Hooks example with usePluginState\n- Added Manual Implementation section\n- Added Event Subscriptions section (onSave, onRestore, onClear)\n- Added Key Points with configuration requirement as #1 item\n- Added Common Errors with solutions\n\n**Enhanced Troubleshooting Section:**\n- Settings Service: ''Setting definition not found'' - step-by-step fix\n- PluginState Service: ''not configured'' - step-by-step fix\n- PluginState Service: State size limit exceeded - solutions\n- Settings vs PluginState comparison table - when to use which\n- Rule of thumb for choosing between services\n\n**Why These Changes:**\nThese updates document the two most common errors developers encounter:\n1. Settings Service failing with ''Setting definition not found'' (fixed in previous commit)\n2. PluginState Service failing with ''not configured'' (fixed in previous commit)\n\nThe documentation now provides clear, actionable solutions to prevent these errors during development.\n\n**Updated Services Interface:**\n- Added pluginState to Services type definition at top of document\n\nTotal additions: ~250 lines of critical documentation","tree":{"sha":"ab3603fb93b99587bec5fa975710aea4a8c7e732","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/trees/ab3603fb93b99587bec5fa975710aea4a8c7e732"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/commits/f789bff27aff2e7b06a2d12a94125b18df443ad8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commit/f789bff27aff2e7b06a2d12a94125b18df443ad8","node_id":"C_kwDOQU7UbNoAKGY3ODliZmYyN2FmZjJlN2IwNmEyZDEyYTk0MTI1YjE4ZGY0NDNhZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commit/a4765d9c8d7a77b5ebd8b51d535dddf5ac3f6ce8","sha":"a4765d9c8d7a77b5ebd8b51d535dddf5ac3f6ce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/a4765d9c8d7a77b5ebd8b51d535dddf5ac3f6ce8"}],"sha":"f789bff27aff2e7b06a2d12a94125b18df443ad8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/f789bff27aff2e7b06a2d12a94125b18df443ad8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/a4765d9c8d7a77b5ebd8b51d535dddf5ac3f6ce8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T16:45:36Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T16:45:36Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"message":"Fix Settings Service - Register settings in lifecycle_manager\n\nFixed critical bug where Settings Service was failing with ''Setting definition not found'' error.\n\n**Root Cause:**\nBrainDrive''s Settings Service requires all settings to be registered in the plugin''s settingDefinitions before they can be used. Previously, the template tried to use settings without declaring them.\n\n**Changes:**\n1. **lifecycle_manager.py**: Added settingDefinitions array to plugin_data\n   - Registered plugin_notifications_enabled (boolean)\n   - Registered plugin_preferences (object)\n   - Each definition includes id, name, description, type, default, category, and scope\n\n2. **useSettings.ts**: Enhanced error handling\n   - Added helpful error message when setting is not found\n   - Directs developers to register settings in lifecycle_manager.py\n\n3. **SettingsServiceTab.tsx**: Updated documentation\n   - Added warning banner about registration requirement\n   - Added Example 3 showing how to register settings in lifecycle_manager.py\n   - Renumbered examples (Direct Access is now Example 4)\n\n**Testing:**\n- Build successful (328 KB)\n- Settings tab now properly declares settings before use\n- Error messages guide developers to fix registration issues\n\nFixes the console error:\nuseSettings: Failed to save setting ''plugin_notifications_enabled'' Error: Setting definition plugin_notifications_enabled not found","tree":{"sha":"8645ce933da55f5750bc067d0d76db0df16868b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/trees/8645ce933da55f5750bc067d0d76db0df16868b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/commits/a4765d9c8d7a77b5ebd8b51d535dddf5ac3f6ce8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt