://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/2b2479ee7c4cf0f0b1c13c698fd982dd1c168b06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T14:38:05Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T14:38:05Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"message":"Add missing PluginState Service Bridge with full implementation\n\nAligned showcase with official BrainDrive documentation by adding the 6th service bridge that was missing from the template.\n\nAdded Components:\n- PluginStateServiceTab component with interactive examples\n- usePluginState custom hook with auto-load, save, and clear operations\n- Full TypeScript interface for PluginStateService\n- CSS styling with theme support\n\nFeatures Demonstrated:\n- Save and load persistent plugin state across sessions\n- Auto-save with debouncing (1s delay)\n- State configuration options (session vs persistent storage)\n- Event subscriptions (onSave, onRestore, onClear)\n- Comprehensive error handling with ErrorHandler integration\n- Interactive counter, user preferences, and form examples\n\nUpdated Files:\n- lifecycle_manager.py: Added pluginState to required_services\n- src/types.ts: Added PluginStateService interface\n- src/hooks/usePluginState.ts: New custom hook (209 lines)\n- src/hooks/index.ts: Export usePluginState\n- ServiceBridgeShowcase.tsx: Added Plugin State tab\n- OverviewTab.tsx: Updated to show 6/6 services\n\nNow showcasing all 6 official BrainDrive service bridges:\n1. Theme Service\n2. API Service\n3. Settings Service\n4. Event Service\n5. Page Context Service\n6. Plugin State Service (NEW)\n\nBuild output: 337 KB total, all TypeScript checks passed.","tree":{"sha":"4fefa08c4d46f529ded17711b56b8d1dbca639cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/trees/4fefa08c4d46f529ded17711b56b8d1dbca639cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/commits/2b2479ee7c4cf0f0b1c13c698fd982dd1c168b06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commit/2b2479ee7c4cf0f0b1c13c698fd982dd1c168b06","node_id":"C_kwDOQU7UbNoAKDJiMjQ3OWVlN2M0Y2YwZjBiMWMxM2M2OThmZDk4MmRkMWMxNjhiMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commit/41a35f5f205e99a4214bfd69aed241db7e22c06c","sha":"41a35f5f205e99a4214bfd69aed241db7e22c06c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/41a35f5f205e99a4214bfd69aed241db7e22c06c"}],"sha":"2b2479ee7c4cf0f0b1c13c698fd982dd1c168b06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/2b2479ee7c4cf0f0b1c13c698fd982dd1c168b06"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/commits/41a35f5f205e99a4214bfd69aed241db7e22c06c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T14:19:49Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T14:19:49Z","email":"47065940+bekmuradov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"message":"Update API Service tab with real BrainDrive endpoints\n\nReplaced JSONPlaceholder demo endpoints with actual BrainDrive backend APIs for more realistic and relevant demonstrations.\n\nChanges:\n- Example 1: GET /api/v1/ai/providers/all-models (fetch available AI models)\n- Example 2: GET /api/v1/tags (list user tags)\n- Example 3: POST /api/v1/tags (create new tag with name and color)\n- Example 4: PUT /api/v1/tags/{tag_id} (update existing tag)\n- Example 5: DELETE /api/v1/tags/{tag_id} (delete tag)\n- Example 6: Error handling demos (404 and 422 validation errors)\n\nAdded features:\n- Color picker input for tag creation/editing\n- Tag ID state management for update/delete operations\n- Real BrainDrive API request/response patterns in code examples\n- User-friendly hints for tag ID workflow\n- Updated best practices section with BrainDrive-specific guidance\n\nAll endpoints are safe for demonstration and testing purposes.","tree":{"sha":"6d589d90c560a9c8dd4947bf5c9a3fa48a4f2d1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/trees/6d589d90c560a9c8dd4947bf5c9a3fa48a4f2d1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/commits/41a35f5f205e99a4214bfd69aed241db7e22c06c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User",