heme custom hook to fix stale closure problem.\n\nChanges:\n- Use useTheme(services.theme, errorHandler) hook on line 109\n- Remove manual theme listener setup in initializeServices\n- Remove manual theme cleanup in cleanupServices\n- Apply currentTheme from hook to UI (line 477, 404)\n\nBenefits:\n- Fixes stale closure issues with theme updates\n- Automatic cleanup handled by hook\n- Eliminates duplicate theme management logic\n- Better reactivity to theme changes\n\nThis ensures theme changes are reflected immediately without refresh.","tree":{"sha":"f264c70a238ba850085e0e1fdd0517b14c48945d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/trees/f264c70a238ba850085e0e1fdd0517b14c48945d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/BrainDrive-PluginTemplate-Functional/git/commits/4060d9151efb7824f9370e21283aa372c68d5e76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/BrainD