"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/agent101/commits/3f4e4527c8107419d13f6f079e091bc24247e794/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-16T02:09:32Z","email":"nirajbhattarai19@gmail.com","name":"NirajBhattarai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-16T02:09:32Z","email":"nirajbhattarai19@gmail.com","name":"NirajBhattarai"},"message":"feat(balance): Add direct tool usage and multi-chain support\n\n- Add balance tools (hedera, ethereum, polygon, all_chains) to balance extractor agent\n- Enable agent to fetch balances directly using tools instead of just extracting parameters\n- Implement type-aware response parsing with proper string/dict handling\n- Add automatic unwrapping of tool responses wrapped in response keys\n- Default to ''all'' chains when EVM address provided but no chain specified\n- Add comprehensive logging for debugging response parsing\n- Organize imports at top of files with proper comments\n- Fix function signatures to use Optional[str] instead of str | None for ADK compatibility\n- Handle both tool responses and extraction responses in executor\n- Add fallback logic to query all chains when chain is unknown but address is provided\n\nThis allows the balance agent to:\n- Fetch native and ERC20 token balances directly from tools\n- Query all chains automatically when chain is not specified\n- Better handle wrapped tool responses from LLM\n- Provide more comprehensive balance information","tree":{"sha":"01e22255a55e1124dfcc26de6729ecd4d99415b7","url