 token-specific balance queries (e.g., ''get USDT on Ethereum'')\n- Add multi-chain token balance queries (e.g., ''get USDT balance'')\n- Add popular tokens feature with CoinGecko integration\n- Add web search fallback for unknown tokens/chains\n- Implement token filtering to return only requested tokens\n- Update orchestrator instructions for proper routing\n- Add token discovery tools (CoinGecko API, web search)\n- Fix native token queries (HBAR, ETH, MATIC) to return only requested token\n- Update frontend CopilotKit instructions for popular tokens support\n\nNew features:\n- Token-specific queries: Returns only the requested token balance\n- Multi-chain token queries: Returns token balances across all chains\n- Popular tokens: Fetches trending tokens and returns their balances\n- Web search fallback: Automatically searches for unknown tokens\n\nDependencies:\n- Add coingecko>=0.13.0 for token discovery\n\nEnvironment variables (optional):\n- COINGECKO_API_KEY: For popular tokens and token discovery\n- GOOGLE_SEARCH_ENGINE_ID: For web search fallback","tree":{"sha":"4ea93001f1cac5956f80ebc0dcb812f83034c5f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/agent101/git/trees/4ea93001f1cac5956f80ebc0dcb812f83034c5f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NirajBhattarai/agent101/git/commits/7895ca5251cb79fde3655ec72b83d3abfdc28e6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39485271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NirajBhattarai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NirajBhattarai","id":39485271,"login":"NirajBhattarai","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDg1Mjcx","organizations_