_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyaiox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cyaiox","id":3170051,"login":"cyaiox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzAwNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyaiox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyaiox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyaiox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyaiox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyaiox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyaiox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decentraland/sites/commits/5a54d3f62f05a5cd83aba3322acbc42573195545/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:08:28Z","email":"gabrieldiaz31@gmail.com","name":"Gabriel Díaz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:08:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add collaborator scenes tab and gate the storage env tab (#841)\n\n* feat: add collaborator scenes tab and gate the storage env tab\n\n- add self-scoped GET /collaborator client, CollaboratorScene types and a paginated discovery hook\n- surface a Collaborations tab on the storage select page (worlds + Genesis City, load-more, realm chip)\n- hide the env tab in collaborator access context, since env is owner/deployer only\n- add en plus es/fr/zh/ko/ja translations for the new strings\n\n* fix: address review feedback on the collaborator scenes tab\n\n* feat: auto-load collaborator scenes on scroll instead of a load more button\n\nThe collaborations tab already accumulated offset pages into one RTK Query\ncache entry and drove them through usePaginatedQuery, but it was the only\npaginated surface in the app that still needed a click. Wire the shared\nuseInfiniteScrollSentinel to it, the same way /places and the community\nMembers/Events lists work.\n\nThe endpoint still paginates at 20 per page; only the trigger changed. The\nsentinel takes isFetchingMore as its isLoading, which keeps the observer\ndisarmed while a page is in flight so it cannot skip an offset.\n\nDrops component.storage.select_page.load_more from all six locales and adds\nthe first SelectPage spec, covering all three tabs.\n\n* fix: add the missing has-name places empty state to fr, ja, ko and zh\n\n#842 shipped profile.places.empty_owner_has_name_subtitle in en and es only,\nso npm run lint:i18n fails on master. Those four locales fell back to the\nEnglish string.\n\nTranslations follow the tone and terminology of the sibling\nempty_owner_subtitle in each file, keeping NAME and World as proper nouns.\nThey are agent-provided and would benefit from a native-speaker review.\n\n* test: read currentData in the SelectPage query mocks\n\nThe rebase onto master picked up #843, which switched usePaginatedQuery and\ngetContributableDomains to currentData so a cache entry from the previous\naccount cannot paint. The mocks still returned data, so the page saw nothing.","tree":{"sha":"80d45cabaa9118df93c641abbc30023bd911cb23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decentraland/sites/git/trees/80d45cabaa9118df93c641abbc30023bd911cb23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decentraland/sites/git/commits/5a54d3f62f05a5cd83aba3322acbc42573195545","verification":{"payload":"tree 80d45cabaa9118df93c641abbc30023bd911cb23\nparent 9938b3e74611643744a9409d217909be1bcb3f59\nauthor Gabriel Díaz <gabrieldiaz31@gmail.com> 1790597308 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790597308 +0200\n\nfeat: add collaborator scenes tab and gate the storage env tab (#841)\n\n* feat: add collaborator scenes tab and gate the storage env tab\n\n- add self-scoped GET /collaborator client, CollaboratorScene types and a paginated discovery hook\n- surface a Collaborations tab on the storage select page (worlds + Genesis City, load-more, realm chip)\n- hide the env tab in collaborator access context, since env is owner/deployer only\n- add en plus es/fr/zh/ko/ja translations for the new strings\n\n* fix: address review feedback on the collaborator scenes tab\n\n* feat: auto-load collaborator scenes on scroll instead of a load more button\n\nThe collaborations tab already accumulated offset pages into one RTK Query\ncache entry and drove them through usePaginatedQuery, but it was the only\npaginated surface in the app that still needed a click. Wire the shared\nuseInfiniteScrollSentinel to it, the same way /places and the community\nMembers/Events lists work.\n\nThe endpoint still paginates at 20 per page; only the trigger changed. The\nsentinel takes isFetchingMore as its isLoading, which keeps the observer\ndisarmed while a page is in flight so it cannot skip an offset.\n\nDrops component.storage.select_page.load_more from all six locales and adds\nthe first SelectPage spec, covering all three tabs.\n\n* fix: add the missing has-name places empty state to fr, ja, ko and zh\n\n#842 shipped profile.places.empty_owner_has_name_subtitle in en and es only,\nso npm run lint:i18n fails on master. Those four locales fell back to the\nEnglish string.\n\nTranslations follow the tone and terminology of the sibling\nempty_owner_subtitle in each file, keeping NAME and World as proper nouns.\nThey are agent-provided and would benefit from a native-speaker review.\n\n* test: read currentData in the SelectPage query mocks\n\nThe rebase onto master picked up #843, which switched usePaginatedQuery and\ngetContributableDomains to currentData so a cache entry from the previous\naccount cannot paint. The mocks still returned data, so the page saw nothing.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquli8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARR4QAJhumsOI5fC04hR+tzQm3gfR\nh9wkF+aqDoWITdhvgnp4jR6HZHxLXy/MIpbuw9iXLrQ1DBRkydYW3iP5edaduJ90\nmEbZ+0LwVjNylnHQqLt2vz6BgJEgvoMLUmdLdWM6ih2ibeF1KPmuLwoPOJ1jDeJq\nKhiBip2eHGdd3wIuY5LDAjHVaHxWaTehemwBFup3F6i9bEz/AgALvUmd2+ETpR07\nxwJUgbCiDTiU8gdMrfMDgu4l2+LcWDAUk