ured_item property to EventEntry constructors\n\nThe new `featured_item: string | null` field was added to the EventEntry\ninterface but two files that construct EventEntry objects were not updated,\ncausing `tsc -b` to fail and blocking the Vercel deployment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add URN validation for featured_item field\n\nValidates that the featured_item value, when provided, matches a\nDecentraland collection or item URN format (collections-v2 on\nmatic/ethereum/amoy/sepolia). Surfaces the error inline on the\ntext field following the existing email validation pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Applied code suggestions\n\n* minor label change\n\n* show featured item URN in the event preview modal\n\n* Updated locales\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: decentraland-bot <44584806+decentraland-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6456fb6100b837a9502d35ef7876ecfc7fd55fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decentraland/sites/git/trees/e6456fb6100b837a9502d35ef7876ecfc7fd55fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decentraland/sites/git/commits/7bcdd9f611f73f88a8840548cfec58b6553ae22c","verification":{"payload":"tree e6456fb6100b837a9502d35ef7876ecfc7fd55fa\nparent 8418cf79d58652e4ac2f47320ccbd3ae222f4e65\nauthor davidejensen <davidejensen@live.it> 1787726478 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787726478 +0200\n\nfeat: add support for featured item field (#765)\n\n* feat: add support for featured item field\n\n* fix: add featured_item i18n keys to all locales and fix indentation\n\nAdd featured_item_label and featured_item_placeholder to es, fr, ja, ko, zh\nlocale files to satisfy 6-locale parity. Fix EventTextField prop indentation\nin EventForm.tsx to match surrounding code style.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add missing featured_item property to EventEntry constructors\n\nThe new `featured_item: string | null` field was added to the EventEntry\ninterface but two files that construct EventEntry objects were not updated,\ncausing `tsc -b` to fail and blocking the Vercel deployment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add URN validation for featured_item field\n\nValidates that the featured_item value, when provided, matches a\nDecentraland collection or item URN format (collections-v2 on\nmatic/ethereum/amoy/sepolia). Surfaces the error inline on the\ntext field following the existing email validation pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Applied code suggestions\n\n* minor label change\n\n* show featured item URN in the event preview modal\n\n* Updated locales\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: decentraland-bot <44584806+decentraland-bot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjoqOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5NoQACPh2kDuKHQyBfDgoQseLHJs\nrMTlF9GswO5g/OBq14WpDd9bguH/Uy4Jd2v11Tt1utEIQAftInlZ5o6mhjsS7zVA\n2pJKcfxs4NrFXdvvCgFhmaUwru64ojUsiFwKqWYPPipvmvz8O5tTPm79YAKf7vdv\nKZPJ3fxVF2vunWtsQNwi+t2lDhaN9kkfbRnndpD54BPu+x5Pyb0RKNnGvS6O5TCg\nGlw0yCd65JTF4oYZpHpJ34s0Z7/JYvhE5YX83Zz2qAwVnUPSiiM10VgU8dQQEbc5\ngrfnXoJB3l0Z3CDmSSQq6lIXHomqTHpRd9qolGPd0OjChQ/hiNspZes1dfQHBmYX\nmRyV2JePWTnSyUJxs9UEXHJF/6vNeIEF8/kdQZaY7ghktXD1Th+ilBds2o4KZos/\nNvpsk0micNFqepIUsaUc97xgDEwCOa8wIby0sFjc5iBajtAgHjxMLNBeZJ4aj12v\nDT1pbkLGg2OGuw5W9zG1ycWz2RXn3gWvqOrAW0h67FWZb10J+YSu72CJ28j1xIDZ\nGAtuRrTy3nSYipzQodDaananCqmT7Vgr9DMtHFGz/C6TCFffDIfrV4A+DRG5ym96\nkxWYAQZ7KlSfinSTufSyf4F5ssA/aHzGvnMKsDMa2Pm3rPOoAvxJ/vlJFgu3BHtp\nn3y8KQ/ZcbNK8I5m/YyN\n=e+zn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T06:41:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","follower