r (no Redux):\n  - Live Scenes: what creators are building right now; a dedicated\n    scenes.discovery client reads the raw hot-scenes feed (the\n    explore-cards pipeline trims to >=5 users / 3 cards and starved\n    the section at quiet hours), showing every occupied non-plaza\n    scene (top 6); cards deep-link to /discover/place/:pos\n  - From the Blog: latest posts via a new plain-fetch cms.discovery\n    client (CMS CORS allows decentraland.org and localhost:5173;\n    section hides gracefully elsewhere)\n- Drop the defunct Studios section: remove the ''hire the best through\n  Decentraland Studios'' pitch and every studios.decentraland.org link\n  (registry program is defunct), including the FAQ clause pitching it\n- CreateCards tabs become an array; the experiences card gains a\n  default ''Create Scenes'' tab linking the Scene Editor docs (about,\n  publish, dev workflow) and the Creator Hub download\n- Mobile: every link now works on a phone — the hero CTA points to the\n  creator docs (Creator Hub installers are Windows/macOS-only and the\n  download page renders no actions on mobile), desktop-only download\n  links are hidden in the Create cards, and internal targets\n  (discover/blog/download) are relative paths instead of hardcoded\n  decentraland.org URLs\n- Reduced style drift against the landing page: one shared\n  CreateSectionTitle (48/600 desktop, 32 mobile — the Home sections''\n  recipe) replaces seven per-section title definitions, dclColors\n  tokens replace raw hex literals across the Create styled files, and\n  the Why CTA follows the landing button language (uppercase, 0.61px\n  tracking, 12px radius)\n- i18n keys added to all six locales; new SectionViewedTrack entries\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bd737d864f6396e6ec73b62d413f31c76a23988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decentraland/sites/git/trees/2bd737d864f6396e6ec73b62d413f31c76a23988"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/decentraland/sites/git/commits/1b440e6f83883785cfb2fbfe13d2dab6a302b9a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 2bd737d864f6396e6ec73b62d413f31c76a23988\nparent f88762a0a1639b33a7d3b1df97a0c6164e5b13f1\nauthor Esteban Ordano <42750+eordano@users.noreply.github.com> 1786799805 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786799805 +0200\n\nfeat: refresh /create with live content and working card links (#748)\n\n- Every card on the page now links somewhere real: Why cards link to\n  Discord, the creator docs, and the creating-wearables guide, each\n  with a CTA button revealed on hover (always visible on touch\n  devices); all five creator testimonials link to their verified\n  profiles (previously 4 of 5 linked nowhere)\n- Learn section refreshed from January-2024 videos to the current\n  creator catalog (2025-2026 uploads, verified alive via oembed)\n- Fixed stale references: creating-wearables docs path (redirected),\n  legacy /places/ target now /discover\n- New live sections on the lightweight tier (no Redux):\n  - Live Scenes: what creators are building right now; a dedicated\n    scenes.discovery client reads the raw hot-scenes feed (the\n    explore-cards pipeline trims to >=5 users / 3 cards and starved\n    the section at quiet hours), showing every occupied non-plaza\n    scene (top 6); cards deep-link to /discover/place/:pos\n  - From the Blog: latest posts via a new plain-fetch cms.discovery\n    client (CMS CORS allows decentraland.org and localhost:5173;\n    section hides gracefully elsewhere)\n- Drop the defunct Studios section: remove the ''hire the best through\n  Decentraland Studios'' pitch and every studios.decentraland.org link\n  (registry program is defunct), including the FAQ clause pitching it\n- CreateCards tabs become an array; the experiences card gains a\n  default ''Create Scenes'' tab linking the Scene Editor docs (about,\n  publish, dev workflow) and the Creator Hub download\n- Mobile: every link now works on a phone — the hero CTA points to the\n  creator docs (Creator Hub installers are Windows/macOS-only and the\n  download page renders no actions on mobile), desktop-only download\n  links are hidden in the Create cards, and internal targets\n  (discover/blog/download) are relative paths instead of hardcoded\n  decentraland.org URLs\n- Reduced style drift against the landing page: one shared\n  CreateSectionTitle (48/600 desktop, 32 mobile — the Home sections''\n  recipe) replaces seven per-section title definitions, dclColors\n  tokens replace raw hex literals across the Create styled files, and\n  the Why CTA follows the landing button language (uppercase, 0.61px\n  tracking, 12px radius)\n- i18n keys added to all six locales; new SectionViewedTrack entries\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgGa9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4dkQAFhb+CvQyFAUJvU5JpbFuZyK\nfWyynio+90jXHrBsub7eIRt2yMl7p8RjU+1A67rJC1SQx2Ez81e7M3BrCMIKzOwP\nbmo/AIeorlQh+6YFfWr2dyp5XdHF1HWeAC36qeLCnUrbEWysR3LMY/OBkXZaf8cm\na/Xb4b05ULfFFRpTDGeq+PDSjFEvSvIQrXvdF22aB5sY6ynm/gqoF3uxE7uRMqlM\n7q20wIeSVkgmIe5b6kVfLyzpDNT8zq4kYU9sCw6Xb8FowRtYKRXAdTRDlwPsT0gI\nmrNbVU0Y2XuX05cp3qMNYuu05fq4qRluuLyZziIIMC4CaAWNKGp/FPKLyFdqFjHq\npfHRD+FKTFCTliVGvhUvzlq2rSGUWARhKIr+PoG6qseovScoNd6cPoj/BH0lap67\nHHEyyi4FGk9w6T8AJN2a//TSK+TDu3Z2V3HeZoPyvLERYgyEdoRiiGGTddr6xVdJ\nzfPO9ZCP7bWXxPjl0OdeBJVClYylJdKIKBFIaAvm/JNi9dNIrtkYJwNjC5V/56Rp\npZEGptkINBnEbnWrv1hwRJ1ZNnqFjI5LBfSicwtcgI/CmYJTwyqmlMvCZlN1l9Ql\nvt5GGp96NcmlqzVTDudlwPg85IA4cB5BlgHwIkZOc4xe9+F8SHtWmIryVEalLz/Q\nrDb+skQAY5NI+wdIVf4P\n=fmF5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-15T13:16:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt