13451c81419ea53234e967886bf30696"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/git/commits/ceed59bd7ac6a682f5aa7a428f3085070f518e05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commit/ceed59bd7ac6a682f5aa7a428f3085070f518e05","node_id":"C_kwDOQVWEv9oAKGNlZWQ1OWJkN2FjNmE2ODJmNWFhN2E0MjhmMzA4NTA3MGY1MThlMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commit/b684a42d97aff20cec6454b874a1c99a535d3c8e","sha":"b684a42d97aff20cec6454b874a1c99a535d3c8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commits/b684a42d97aff20cec6454b874a1c99a535d3c8e"}],"sha":"ceed59bd7ac6a682f5aa7a428f3085070f518e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commits/ceed59bd7ac6a682f5aa7a428f3085070f518e05"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commits/b684a42d97aff20cec6454b874a1c99a535d3c8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T15:01:38Z","email":"ap-project@example.com","name":"AP-Project-User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T15:01:38Z","email":"ap-project@example.com","name":"AP-Project-User"},"message":"feat: 完成 Sprint 1-13 完整文檔體系建立\n\n## 主要成果\n\n### 1. 規劃文檔 (claudedocs/1-planning/)\n- ✅ MVP 範圍定義\n- ✅ Sprint 分配分析 (21 Sprints)\n- ✅ 開發策略與技術決策\n- ✅ 依賴矩陣與風險登記\n\n### 2. Sprint 文檔 (claudedocs/2-sprints/)\n完成 Sprint 1-12 的完整文檔 (每個 Sprint 7 個文件):\n- ✅ Sprint 1-6: Phase 1A 基礎平台\n- ✅ Sprint 7-9: Phase 1B 工作流引擎核心\n- ✅ Sprint 10-11: Phase 1C 工作流編輯器 Backend\n- ✅ Sprint 12: Phase 1D 工作流編輯器 Frontend (VueFlow)\n- 🚧 Sprint 13: Phase 1D 節點系統 (進行中)\n\n### 3. 文檔標準\n- 遵循 v2.1 標準 (8 欄位 header)\n- 完整參考文獻索引 (70+ 文檔)\n- 統一命名規則 (SPRINT-X-Y-NAME.md)\n- 100% 格式一致性\n\n### 4. 文檔統計\n- 總文件數: 160+ 個\n- Sprint 文檔: 84 個 (Sprint 1-12)\n- 規劃文檔: 8 個\n- 模板文檔: 7 個\n- 總大小: ~15 MB\n\n## 技術亮點\n\n### Phase 完成狀態\n- ✅ Phase 1A: Agent 基礎平台 (Sprint 1-6, 100%)\n- ✅ Phase 1B: 工作流引擎核心 (Sprint 7-9, 100%)\n- ✅ Phase 1C: Workflow Editor Backend (Sprint 10-11, 100%)\n- 🚧 Phase 1D: Workflow Editor Frontend (Sprint 12-14, 33%)\n\n### 架構決策\n- Clean Architecture + DDD + CQRS\n- Semantic Kernel 1.66.0+\n- Vue 3 + VueFlow 微前端架構\n- PostgreSQL + Redis + Qdrant\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d527bbd2301ae25d0ae64845c45497bae6dfedee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/git/trees/d527bbd2301ae25d0ae64845c45497bae6dfedee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/git/commits/b684a42d97aff20cec6454b874a1c99a535d3c8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commit/b684a42d97aff20cec6454b874a1c99a535d3c8e","node_id":"C_kwDOQVWEv9oAKGI2ODRhNDJkOTdhZmYyMGNlYzY0NTRiODc0YTFjOTlhNTM1ZDNjOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commit/d586462ac3790ed31c8c787a1bbe01651f87416b","sha":"d586462ac3790ed31c8c787a1bbe01651f87416b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commits/d586462ac3790ed31c8c787a1bbe01651f87416b"}],"sha":"b684a42d97aff20cec6454b874a1c99a535d3c8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commits/b684a42d97aff20cec6454b874a1c99a535d3c8e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commits/d586462ac3790ed31c8c787a1bbe01651f87416b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T01:30:40Z","email":"ap-project@example.com","name":"AP-Project-User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T01:30:40Z","email":"ap-project@example.com","name":"AP-Project-User"},"message":"Initial commit: Semantic Kernel Agentic Framework project setup\n\nThis commit includes the complete project documentation structure:\n- BMad Method framework configuration (.bmad/)\n- Comprehensive documentation (docs/)\n  - Project Brief and Architecture Design Document\n  - 43 User Stories across 10 modules\n  - Sprint planning for 18 sprints\n  - UX/UX design documentation\n  - Technical implementation guides\n- CLAUDE.md for AI assistant guidance\n- README.md with project overview\n\nProject Status:\n- Phase 3.4 (Tech Lead) completed\n- Sprint 1 in progress (33% complete)\n- Agent CRUD API implemented and tested\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05dd76d9ee4b30d9f8cf7f16178fc12fb9376b4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/git/trees/05dd76d9ee4b30d9f8cf7f16178fc12fb9376b4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/git/commits/d586462ac3790ed31c8c787a1bbe01651f87416b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commit/d586462ac3790ed31c8c787a1bbe01651f87416b","node_id":"C_kwDOQVWEv9oAKGQ1ODY0NjJhYzM3OTBlZDMxYzhjNzg3YTFiYmUwMTY1MWY4NzQxNmI","parents":[],"sha":"d586462ac3790ed31c8c787a1bbe01651f87416b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commits/d586462ac3790ed31c8c787a1bbe01651f87416b"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/laitim2001/ai-semantic-kernel-project/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=ceed59bd7ac6a682f5aa7a428f3085070f518e05&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A16%3A39.494Z"}');
